  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Description: When a user attempts to send the beach ball emoji, the emoji is not sent out.\nRetro steps: There are two methods to attempt sending the beack ball emoji. Firstly, hit Y, B, or the Menu button (Oculus) to enter the main menu. Select \"Emoji\" in the bottom row. Select the Up arrow to sabotage to the Summer themed emoji page. Select the beach ball. Alternatively, you can enter the quick menu using thumbstick click or Y+Trigger/B+Trigger (Oculus). Use thumbstick to navigate to emojis, then to the Summer category. Use the thumbstick to hit the beach ball and release to send the beach ball.\nExpected: As it should with any other emoji, the beach ball should fly forward with an animation in the direction the user's head is facing.\nActual: There is no visible beach ball to be seen from either the user's perspective or any viewing parties. Multiple users have found the same result.\nTested on user's with Quest, Rift CV1, Rift S, Valve Index",
